        "hs_methods": "Arabidopsis thaliana semi-solid MM2d undifferentiated callus cell cultures (1–2 mm layer on 1% agar MS medium; lacking statoliths). | Platform: Ground-based multi-simulator campaign (200 min exposure, 22°C, total darkness):"
