        "hs_methods": "Arabidopsis thaliana — Col-0 (Wild Type) and cax1-1 (vacuolar Ca2+/H+ antiporter knockout, At2g38170) for transcriptomics; Col-0, Ws, mrs2-10 (At1g80900 knockout), sel1-10 (AtSULTR1;2 knockout), cax1-1, and cax1/cax3 for 4-week soil growth…"
