        "hs_methods": "Arabidopsis thaliana — Col-0 Wild Type (GW ground, SW spaceflight) and act2-3 vegetative actin-2 mutant (GA ground, SA spaceflight). | Platform: BRIC-16 (Biological Research in Canisters, unpowered complete darkness) aboard Space Shuttle…"
