        "hs_methods": "Arabidopsis thaliana wild-type cultivar Wassilewskija (WS, Ferl lab line propagated ~25 years, ABRC stock CS915), dissected into root and leaf tissues (n = 3 biological replicates per organ × condition). | Platform: APEX03-2 (Advanced…"
