        "k5_mystery": "How does Arabidopsis thaliana ecotype Columbia survive and grow inside Custom two-unit polysulfone culture… without normal Earth conditions?",
        "k5_discovery": "Scientists discovered that helper genes like Dr. Cai switch on to protect the plant! Key clue: Dr. Cai: Lead scientist at the Shanghai Institute of Plant Physiology and Ecology (CAS), who…",
