        "hs_methods": "Arabidopsis thaliana ecotype Columbia (Col-0) | Platform: Custom two-unit polysulfone culture chamber assembly with gas-permeable membrane windows, canal system, pump support system, and tube-connected RNAlater® fixative unit designed by…"
