        "k5_mystery": "How does Arabidopsis thaliana Columbia survive and grow inside TROPI EMCS Phototropism Rig without normal Earth conditions?",
        "k5_discovery": "Scientists discovered that helper genes like Dr. Herranz switch on to protect the plant! Key clue: Dr. Herranz: (Centro de Investigaciones Biológicas Margarita Salas [CIB-CSIC], Madrid): Principal…",
