        "hs_methods": "Arabidopsis thaliana Columbia (Col-0 WT), nuc1-2 (Salk002764), and nuc2-2 (GABI178D01). | Platform: NASA Tropi Experiment Unique Equipment (EUE) culture chambers (CC cassettes, 5 per Experiment Container EC) with semiautomatic hydration…"
