        "k5_mystery": "How does Arabidopsis thaliana Columbia survive and grow inside EMCS Centrifuge (ISS) without normal Earth conditions?",
        "k5_discovery": "Scientists discovered that helper genes like Alicia… switch on to protect the plant! Key clue: Alicia…: (CIB-CSIC, Madrid, Co-First Authors): Dissected the FixBox-preserved root meristems…",
