        "k5_mystery": "How does Arabidopsis thaliana survive and grow inside BRIC Flight Canisters without normal Earth conditions?",
        "k5_discovery": "Scientists discovered that helper genes like Dr. Brandizzi switch on to protect the plant! Key clue: Dr. Brandizzi: (Principal Investigator, Michigan State University) — ER-stress pioneer who designed…",
        "ms_experiment": "NASA study OSD-321 tested Arabidopsis thaliana inside BRIC Flight Canisters (ISS), comparing space/stress conditions against matched terrestrial controls.",
